From 2a4521da5363a9ce06b7a6dd2af5b5cd20396a3d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alaric McKenzie-Boone <alaric.mckenzie.boone@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 05:58:51 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 14/17] Add P2 electric/gas Pikmin reaction states and route
 receivers (#170/#408)

Add PIKISTATE_DenkiDying and PIKISTATE_Panic with PikiDenkiDyingState and
PikiPanicState, registered in PikiStateMachine::init so they are reachable.
Route InteractDenki::actPiki / InteractGas::actPiki non-immune paths into the
new states through the testable pc_p2_hazard_reaction helper, keeping the
lane-11 immunity matrix intact. Add the narrow Piki::gasInvicible gate and a
standalone tools test.
